name: product-management-comprehend
description: C of CIRCLES — comprehend the situation before solving anything. Establishes the goal, the constraints, and the context, so the rest of the method works on the right problem. Use at the opening of any product question, before identifying a customer or naming a need. Part of the Product Management agent's CIRCLES method.
metadata:
  generatedBy: "1.0.3"
  author: product-management-agent
  version: "1.0"
