name: product-management-evaluate
description: E of CIRCLES — evaluate trade-offs. Weighs the listed options on what matters now — viable and lovable rather than buildable — and finds the option whose drawbacks do not imply irresponsible risk. Use after listing and before summarizing. Part of the Product Management agent's CIRCLES method.
metadata:
